title: Undoing past a save leaves the file unsaved (quit asks), and redo back to the saved text makes it clean again
prefs: {"autosave": false}
folders: plain
limit: 40
forbid-log: cannot edit
forbid-log: nothing offers
expect-file: plain/src/util.rs :: (?-i)\Aonetwo\npub fn double

wait 3000
edit src/util.rs 1 1
key enter
key up
type one
type two
key save
wait 600
key undo
wait 300
mark undone-past-save
wait 400
quit
wait 800
mark asked
wait 400
answer Cancel
wait 400
key redo
wait 300
mark redone-to-saved
wait 400
quit
